 "policy": "1. For PPO plans we are in network with, write off the difference between our fee and the allowed amount, using the PPO Write-Off adjustment.\n2. Delta Dental Premier: write off the difference down to the Premier allowed amount with the Premier Adj adjustment.\n3. Deductibles and coinsurance go on the patient's account; we never write those off.\n4. A balance under $5 left after insurance can be written off as Small Balance W/O.\n5. Denied claims are never written off automatically. Hold them for the billing coordinator.\n6. If an insurance company pays more than it should, flag it for a refund review.\n7. The office is closed for lunch from 12 to 1.",
